# Mondo Website Project Rules

## Tech Stack Constraints

- Pure vanilla web: semantic HTML5, clean modern CSS3, and vanilla modern JavaScript (ES6+).
- Strictly NO Node.js, npm, package.json, bundlers, or third-party JS frameworks.
- Directory Structure:
  - Root: index.html, README.md
  - assets/css/style.css
  - assets/js/script.js
  - assets/images/
  - assets/audio/

## Design and Aesthetic

- Client: Hip-hop / Rap artist (Mondo).
- Theme: Bold, modern, autumn-inspired color palette:
  - Deep Rust / Orange-Red accents: #B85A24, #D96B43
  - Warm Gold: #E09F3E
  - Deep Teal / Slate contrast: #335C67, #546A5B
  - Off-White / Cream background: #FFF9F2
  - Dark Charcoal / Ink text and dark cards: #2B2D42
- Layout: Mobile-first, responsive, accessible, high visual impact.

## Deliverable Quality

- Ensure all interactive elements (navigation toggles, audio players, modals) work with vanilla JS event listeners.
- Add explicit image dimension placeholders to eliminate layout shift.
- Test compatibility with Python's local server (`python -m http.server 8000`).
